{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>And he shall offer.</b> Both of them — the lamb and the turtledove or young pigeon — and the verse held to a concise path. So too it did not mention מליקת חטאת העוף (the pinching of the bird sin-offering), for the priest does not eat a bird sin-offering." "<b>And he shall make atonement for her.</b> As I have explained." "<b>And she shall be purified from the source of her blood.</b> This is a sign that she is not purified of her flow until the counted days."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:09:45.387213425Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}